        "direction": "horizontal",
        "connector": "arrow",
        "illustration": "left_inside",
        "icons": "auto"
      },
      {
        "type": "tag",
        "text_ref": "不够才走这步"
      },
      {
        "type": "flow",
        "text_ref": "4选中再核对只完整读选中的这一份，算SHA-256内容指纹，和登记时的大小、指纹比5翻到那一页读出这一份的文字，返回页码、段落或行号，附不超",
        "columns": 3,
        "direction": "horizontal",
        "connector": "arrow",
        "illustration": "left_inside",
        "icons": "auto"
      },
